  "description": "Desperate to save his father from crushing debt, Mi-Eum is compelled to accept a risky offer from a ruthless loan shark. The terms are clear: assume the role of a house servant and get close and gather vital information about the enigmatic young master of the house, Baek Ji-Tae. Upon entering his new workplace, Mi-Eum's mission takes an unexpected turn as he's assigned to assist Ji-Tae with an unusual task - his bath. Mi-Eum understands that this unique opportunity is his key to getting closer to his target. Yet, the moment their eyes meet, Mi-Eum realizes that no matter how much he may cry and weep, there is truly no turning back now. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
